{"hw":"θεμιτός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">θεμιτός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θεμιτ-ός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">θέμις</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">allowed by the laws of God and men, righteous</b>, <span class=\"gk\">οὐ θεμιτόν [ἐστι]</span>,= <span class=\"gk\">οὐ θέμις</span>, c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">οὐ θ. οἱ ἔφασκε πίνειν οἶνον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">h.Cer.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">207</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.42</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">993</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1758</span> </span> (anap.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">97</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.136</span> </span>, etc.: in Prose, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.37</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.72</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">30d</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1059.16</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.1390<